> © 2019 Thurlow Church of England (VC) Primary School.
As a Local Authority Maintained school Suffolk County Council is responsible for co-ordinating the admission arrangements for the normal year of entry at a school.
Children enter Thurlow CE VCP School during the academic year in which they have their fifth birthday. We have a Pupil Admission Number (PAN) of 15.
